  (e) Remove, obscure or alter any copyright notice, licence notice, trademark
      or attribution contained in or displayed by the Software.

  (f) Use the Software, its source code, its design, its algorithms or any
      portion thereof to build, train, benchmark or improve any competing
      product, service, model or tool.

  (g) Circumvent, disable or remove any licence check, entitlement verification
      or usage limit embedded in the Software.

  (h) Re-publish, re-host or re-distribute binary releases through any
      channel other than links directly to the official Cambric GitHub releases
      page.

  (i) Claim authorship of or misrepresent the origin of the Software.

