        — referral to law enforcement where criminal provisions apply.

  (c) GitHub DMCA takedown notices and platform-abuse reports will be filed
      without prior warning for repositories that fork, mirror or redistribute
      this Software without authorisation.

Cambric actively monitors public repositories and code-hosting services for
unauthorised copies or derivatives of this Software.

