6. USER DATA AND PRIVACY
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  (a) Data you create with the Software (phrases, medical information, enrolled
      faces, caption history) belongs to you and is stored only on your device.
      Cambric does not receive it.

  (b) The Software has no account system, no analytics, and no telemetry.

  (c) The optional update-check contacts api.github.com to read the latest
      release tag. It transmits no personal data beyond the IP address of the
      HTTP request, and GitHub's privacy terms govern that exchange.

